ps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98494.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"A small addition to the DAP interface to allow a client to pass a `scene` parameter that points to a local `tscn` file.\r\n\r\nExample config for nvim with a simple picker to select the custom scene to run.\r\n```lua\r\nlocal dap = require('dap')\r\ndap.configurations.gdscript = {\r\n  {\r\n    type = \"godot\",\r\n    request = \"launch\",\r\n    name = \"Launch scene\",\r\n    scene = function()\r\n      local path = vim.fn.input({\r\n        prompt = 'Path to scene: ',\r\n        default = vim.fn.getcwd() .. '/',\r\n        completion = 'file'\r\n      })\r\n      return (path and path ~= \"\") and path or dap.ABORT\r\n    end\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98494/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98494/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}